    "industrial_process_notes": "PEKK is a semi-crystalline thermoplastic in the polyaryletherketone (PAEK) family, offering high heat, chemical, and mechanical load resistance. Increasingly manufactured via additive manufacturing (3D printing) for aerospace and medical parts -- e.g. Hexcel supplies PEKK components for Boeing's CST-100 Starliner spacecraft via this route.",
